 reduction efforts are on plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/sunoco-lp-sun-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SUN 2020 Q2","e":"sun","d":"2020-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Karl Fails","x":"As I mentioned in my remarks, with the lower volumes in the second quarter, clearly, we had more cost savings related to that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/sunoco-lp-sun-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SUN 2020 Q3","e":"sun","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Grischow","x":"However, we continue to deliver on our cost-reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/sunoco-lp-sun-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2020 Q3","e":"sun","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kim","x":"Our third quarter performance highlights the top line resiliency of our business model, as well as the continued execution of our cost-reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/sunoco-lp-sun-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2020 Q4","e":"sun","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kim","x":"We're seeing this play out, as the market continues to pass on price increases to the rack and to the street.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/sunoco-lp-sun-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2020 Q4","e":"sun","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dylan Bramhall","x":"Our cost reduction initiatives resulted in total operating expenses of $448 million, which was a reduction of 11% from 2019 levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/sunoco-lp-sun-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2020 Q4","e":"sun","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Shneur Gershuni","x":"But are you able to handicap how much of the cost savings that you achieve during 2020 that you'll be able to permanently capture on a go-forward basis?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/sunoco-lp-sun-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2021 Q1","e":"sun","d":"2021-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dylan Bramhall","x":"These expenses are down approximately 30% from the $143 million in the first quarter of 2020, and are largely a reflection of our cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/sunoco-lp-sun-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2021 Q1","e":"sun","d":"2021-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dylan Bramhall","x":"We also reiterate our annual guidance for fuel volumes in a range of 7.25 billion to 7.75 billion gallons, total operating expenses between $440 million and $450 million and maintenance capital of $45 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/sunoco-lp-sun-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2021 Q2","e":"sun","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Karl R. Fails","x":"Theres some cost savings as we integrate into our broader network and optimize some of those costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/sunoco-lp-sun-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2021 Q3","e":"sun","d":"2021-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dylan Bramhall","x":"However, we expect the full year to come in below our previously guided range due to the extension of many of our 2020 cost-cutting initiatives throughout the first half of 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/sunoco-lp-sun-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2021 Q4","e":"sun","d":"2022-02-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Kim","x":"We're seeing this play out as the market is passing on price increases to the rack and street.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/16/sunoco-sun-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2021 Q4","e":"sun","d":"2022-02-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Karl Fails","x":"On gasoline prices and maybe inflation in general, the first when you already commented on is that in many ways, the inflationary pressures are passed through in that they increase the break-even margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/16/sunoco-sun-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2022 Q1","e":"sun","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Karl Fails","x":"In the first quarter, we delivered strong margins of $12.4 per gallon, even in the face of the record price increases across the quarter that I already shared.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/sunoco-sun-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2022 Q1","e":"sun","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Karl Fails","x":"The most important thing to keep in mind is that higher costs are generally passed through and contribute to higher breakeven margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/sunoco-sun-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2022 Q2","e":"sun","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Karl Fails","x":"This is one more period of strong margins even in the face of dramatic price increases across the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/03/sunoco-sun-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2022 Q2","e":"sun","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Karl Fails","x":"In addition, when we compare to last year, there are some items like credit card fees that are higher in the current market condition, but are generally passed through and don't impact our EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/03/sunoco-sun-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SUN 2026 Q1","e":"sun","d":"2026-05-05","l